# Sections
absence-types-title = Absence Types
absence-types-description = Create and maintain the base absence categories used across HR.
absence-groups-title = Absence Groups
absence-groups-description = Organize absence types into groups.
absence-groups-readonly-description = System-driven grouping used by runtime forms. Review only in setup; create/delete remains blocked here.
